@startuml
actor User
participant "Folder Detail UI" as UI <<UI>>
participant ":FolderTestEndpoints" as FolderTestEndpoints <<Controller>>
participant ":SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler" as SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler <<Handler>>
participant ":ApplicationDbContext" as ApplicationDbContext <<DbContext>>
participant Database

note right of SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
  Managed by MediatR
end note

note right of ApplicationDbContext
  Managed by IoC
end note

User -> UI : Search for test templates in folder
activate UI
UI -> FolderTestEndpoints : GET /api/Folder/{FolderId}/TestTemplates?testTemplateName=...
activate FolderTestEndpoints
FolderTestEndpoints -> SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler : Handle(SearchTestTemplateInFolderQuery)
deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
activate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> ApplicationDbContext : Query FolderUsers (Include Folder) by FolderId and UserId
deactivate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext -> Database : Query FolderUsers, Folder
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate Database
Database --> ApplicationDbContext : FolderUser, Folder
deactivate Database
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext --> SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler : FolderUser (accessUser)
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
alt User Not Have Permission in Folder
    SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> FolderTestEndpoints : Error: COMMON_FORBIDDEN
    deactivate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
    activate FolderTestEndpoints
    FolderTestEndpoints --> UI : 400 Bad Request { "error": "COMMON_FORBIDDEN" }
    deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
    UI -> User : Display error: User does not have permission in folder
else User Has Permission
    activate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
    SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> ApplicationDbContext : Query FolderTestTemplates (Include TestTemplate, Questions, CreatedByUser)
    deactivate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
    activate ApplicationDbContext
    ApplicationDbContext -> Database : Query FolderTestTemplates, TestTemplate, Questions, User
    deactivate ApplicationDbContext
    activate Database
    Database --> ApplicationDbContext : List<FolderTestTemplate>, TestTemplate, Questions, User
    deactivate Database
    activate ApplicationDbContext
    ApplicationDbContext --> SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler : List<FolderTestTemplate>
    deactivate ApplicationDbContext
    activate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
    SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler : Filter by FolderId, IsDeleted, TestTemplateName
    SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler : Map to TestTemplateDto
    SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler -> FolderTestEndpoints : SearchTestTemplateInFolderDto (with PaginatedList<TestTemplateDto>)
    deactivate SearchTestTemplateInFolderQueryHandler
    activate FolderTestEndpoints
    FolderTestEndpoints --> UI : 200 OK (ApiResponse<SearchTestTemplateInFolderDto>)
    deactivate FolderTestEndpoints
    UI -> User : Show test templates in folder
end
deactivate UI

@enduml